  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Reading The Legends of Ren Zu, Fang Yuan lists pride Gu with hope Gu, vanity Gu, guts Gu, stubborn Gu, self Gu, and suffering Gu, and treats them as human path Gu worms.",
        "chapters": [
          1774
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_hope_gu",
          "gu_vanity_gu",
          "gu_guts_gu",
          "gu_self_gu",
          "gu_suffering_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lu Wei Yin judges with uncertainty that the core Immortal Gu of a wisdom path killer move that struck him is pride Gu. Fang Yuan agrees with that deduction. Lu Wei Yin adds that Fairy Ming Hao has humility Gu and pride Gu, which reminds him of The Legends of Ren Zu.",
        "chapters": [
          2160
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "core-gu-deduction",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lu_wei_yin",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_fairy_ming_hao",
          "gu_humility_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the Book Mountain stretch, Ren Zu finds a Gu occupying his mind and preventing more knowledge. It answers that it is pride Gu and refuses to leave no matter how he urges. Great Strength True Martial gives him humility Gu; pride Gu is chased out of Ren Zu’s mind and lands on Great Strength True Martial instead. Strong Gu is happy that the strong have their own pride.",
        "chapters": [
          2161
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "in-ren-zus-mind",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_book_mountain",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "char_great_strength_true_martial",
          "gu_strong_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
